<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
<title>Trip Control — Yearly Travel Planning</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/trip.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <div class="brand" data-nav="home">
      <div class="brand-mark"></div>
      <div><div class="brand-name">TRIP CONTROL</div><div class="brand-sub">Yearly Planning Console</div></div>
    </div>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle">☰</button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <div class="nav-link" data-nav="home">Home</div>
      <div class="nav-link" data-nav="explore">Explore</div>
      <div class="nav-link" data-nav="planner">Plan my year</div>
      <div class="nav-link" data-nav="dashboard">My trips</div>
      <div class="nav-link" data-nav="how">How it works</div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-nav="planner">Launch planner</button>
      <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;">Hi, <%= user ? user.firstName : 'Guest' %></span>
      <form action="/logout" method="POST" style="margin:0;">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Logout</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ HOME PAGE ============ -->
<div class="page" id="page-home"><div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:10px;">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Input → Engine → Database → Output</div>
      <div id="continueBanner"></div>
      <h1>Plan a whole year of<br>travel <em>on one screen.</em></h1>
      <p>Set your budget, your radius, and who's coming — the matching engine checks every destination in the database against your duration, budget, distance and travel-affinity rules, then builds your weekend calendar and major trip itinerary in rupees.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-nav="planner">Start planning</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-nav="explore">Explore destinations</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="radar-card">
        <div class="radar-ring" style="inset:14%;"></div>
        <div class="radar-ring" style="inset:32%;"></div>
        <div class="radar-ring" style="inset:50%;"></div>
        <div class="radar-sweep"></div>
        <div class="radar-home"></div>
        <div id="homeRadarDots"></div>
        <div class="radar-caption" id="homeRadarCaption"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">How it works</div><h2>Four layers, one plan</h2><p>Ported straight from the original system architecture — input, logic, database, output.</p></div>
    <div class="step-strip">
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">01</div><h4>Tell it your constraints</h4><p>Home city, budget in ₹, travel radius, and who's travelling with you.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">02</div><h4>The engine runs four checks</h4><p>Duration, budget alignment, distance, and travel-affinity — live, on every destination.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">03</div><h4>Pull from the database</h4><p>28 Indian destinations served from the server API, with real costs, durations, and best-fit tags.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">04</div><h4>Get a finished plan</h4><p>A 12-slot weekend calendar and a finalized major-trip itinerary, budgeted in ₹.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Snapshot</div><h2>The database at a glance</h2></div>
    <div class="stat-strip" id="homeStats"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Featured</div><h2>A few places to start with</h2><p>Pulled from the full catalogue — open Explore to filter all 28.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-rail" id="featRail"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Built for</div><h2>However you travel</h2></div>
    <div class="persona-grid">
      <div class="persona-card"><span class="tagchip">solo</span><h4>Solo travellers</h4><p>Offbeat, budget-first matches — cafe towns, treks, and quiet coastlines the engine tags for independent travel.</p></div>
      <div class="persona-card"><span class="tagchip">family with kids</span><h4>Families with kids</h4><p>Duration and pace suited to children, with an age field that flags kid-friendly stays.</p></div>
      <div class="persona-card"><span class="tagchip">parents & elders</span><h4>Parents &amp; elders</h4><p>Slower itineraries and a preference for accessible, comfortable accommodation.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>

<!-- ============ PLANNER PAGE ============ -->
<div class="page" id="page-planner"><div class="wrap">
  <section style="padding-bottom:10px;">
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">01 · Input Layer</div><h2>Your profile &amp; planning preferences</h2><p>Everything here feeds the decision engine below. Your plan saves to your account automatically.</p></div>
    <div class="panel input-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Home city (centre point)</label><select id="homeCity"></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Trip type selector</label><div class="radio-row" id="tripTypeRow"></div></div>
        <div class="field" id="durationField">
          <label class="flabel">Major trip duration</label>
          <input type="range" id="durSlider" min="7" max="10" value="7">
          <div class="range-readout"><span>7 days</span><span id="durReadout">7 days</span><span>10 days</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Traveller type</label><div class="radio-row" id="travelerRow"></div></div>
        <div class="field" id="kidsField" style="display:none;"><label class="flabel">Youngest child's age</label><input type="number" id="kidsAge" min="0" max="17" value="7"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Travellers on this trip</label><input type="number" id="travelers" min="1" max="12" value="1"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel input-grid" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Local radius — weekend trips</label><input type="range" id="radiusSlider" min="50" max="600" step="10" value="300"><div class="range-readout"><span>50 km</span><span id="radiusReadout">300 km</span><span>600 km</span></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Weekend slot target (yearly)</label><input type="number" id="slotTarget" min="1" max="12" value="12"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Weekend trip budget (₹, per trip)</label><div class="currency-input"><input type="number" id="weekendBudget" value="8000" step="500"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Major trip budget (₹, per trip)</label><div class="currency-input"><input type="number" id="majorBudget" value="45000" step="1000"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="flabel">Total yearly budget (₹)</label><div class="currency-input"><input type="number" id="yearlyBudget" value="150000" step="5000"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">02 · Decision Support &amp; Logic Layer</div><h2>Trip matching &amp; filtering engine</h2><p>Four checks run against every destination: duration fit, budget alignment, distance-from-home, and travel-affinity match.</p></div>
    <div class="ai-toolbar">
      <div class="ai-toolbar-info">
        <strong>AI Yearly Planner</strong>
        <span>Route your profile through Gemini + live weather + flight pricing to auto-build your whole year.</span>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="aiGenerateBtn">✨ Generate AI Plan</button>
      <div class="ai-availability" id="aiAvail"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-status" id="aiStatus" style="display:none;"></div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="engine-grid" id="engineGrid"></div>
      <div class="run-row"><div class="overall-match">Overall matches this query: <b id="overallCount">0</b> <span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted);">/ <span id="totalDestCount">0</span> destinations</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="runBtn">Run matching engine</button></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">02b · Travel Affinity &amp; Accommodation Match</div><h2>Matched destinations</h2><p>Add a match straight to your weekend calendar or set it as this year's major trip.</p></div>
    <div id="aiLayerInfo"></div>
    <div class="tabs" id="modeTabs"></div>
    <div class="card-grid" id="cardGrid"></div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">03 · Output Layer</div><h2>Your plan so far</h2><p>Full detail, readiness score, and export live on the <a href="#/dashboard" style="color:var(--teal);">My trips</a> page.</p></div>
    <div id="aiSummaryBox" style="display:none;"></div>
    <div class="output-grid">
      <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;">Weekend calendar</h3><div class="cal-grid" id="calGrid"></div></div>
      <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;">Major trip</h3><div id="majorTripCard"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel budget-summary" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <div class="budget-row"><span>Yearly budget used</span><b id="budgetUsedLabel">₹0 of ₹0</b></div>
      <div class="budget-track"><div class="budget-fill" id="budgetFillBar"></div></div>
      <div class="budget-warn" id="budgetWarnText" style="display:none;">Over your yearly budget — remove a slot or lower the major trip cost.</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>

<!-- ============ EXPLORE PAGE ============ -->
<div class="page" id="page-explore"><div class="wrap">
  <section style="padding-bottom:16px;">
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Master Travel Database</div><h2>Explore every destination</h2><p>Search and filter the full catalogue, independent of your planner settings.</p></div>
    <div class="explore-context" id="exploreContext"></div>
    <div class="filter-bar">
      <input type="text" id="exSearch" placeholder="Search name or state…">
      <select id="exRegion"></select>
      <select id="exSort">
        <option value="name">Sort: A–Z</option>
        <option value="distance">Sort: distance</option>
        <option value="price">Sort: price (low first)</option>
        <option value="duration">Sort: duration (short first)</option>
      </select>
      <div class="chip-toggle" id="exTags">
        <button class="chip" data-tag="solo">Solo</button>
        <button class="chip" data-tag="family">Family with kids</button>
        <button class="chip" data-tag="elders">Parents &amp; elders</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-count" id="exCount"></div>
    <div class="explore-grid" id="exploreGrid"></div>
  </section>
</div></div>

<!-- ============ DASHBOARD PAGE ============ -->
<div class="page" id="page-dashboard"><div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">My Trips</div><h2>Your yearly plan</h2><p>Everything you've added, in one place — export it, edit it, or start over.</p></div>
    <div class="readiness-strip" id="readinessStrip"></div>

    <div class="output-grid">
      <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;">Weekend calendar</h3><div class="cal-grid" id="calGrid2"></div></div>
      <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;">Major trip</h3><div id="majorTripCard2"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel budget-summary" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <div class="budget-row"><span>Yearly budget used</span><b id="budgetUsedLabel2">₹0 of ₹0</b></div>
      <div class="budget-track"><div class="budget-fill" id="budgetFillBar2"></div></div>
      <div class="budget-warn" id="budgetWarnText2" style="display:none;">Over your yearly budget — remove a slot or lower the major trip cost.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);">
        <span>Weekend spend: <b class="mono" id="weekendSpendLabel2" style="color:var(--cream);">₹0</b></span>
        <span>Major trip spend: <b class="mono" id="majorSpendLabel2" style="color:var(--cream);">₹0</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-nav="planner">Edit in planner</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="copyPlanBtn">Copy plan as text</button>
      <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" id="resetPlanBtn">Reset plan</button>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>

<!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS PAGE ============ -->
<div class="page" id="page-how"><div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Architecture</div><h2>How Trip Control is built</h2><p>Ported from the original system-architecture roadmap: an input layer, a decision-support and logic layer, a persistence layer, and an output layer.</p></div>

    <div class="arch-layer">
      <span class="tag">Input layer</span><h3>User profile &amp; planning preferences</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0;">Trip type, yearly trip count, budget constraints in rupees, traveller type, and accommodation preference.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="arch-layer">
      <span class="tag">Decision support &amp; logic layer (middleware)</span><h3>Trip matching &amp; filtering engine</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0;">Four modules run on every destination before it can be called a match.</p>
      <div class="arch-sub-grid">
        <div class="arch-sub"><h5>Geospatial filter &amp; location search</h5><p>Great-circle distance from your home city, checked against a configurable radius (default 300 km).</p></div>
        <div class="arch-sub"><h5>Duration check module</h5><p>Fixed logic for 2–3 day weekends, or a 7–10 day window for major vacations.</p></div>
        <div class="arch-sub"><h5>Budget alignment module</h5><p>Per-trip budget in ₹, checked against cost-per-day × travellers × duration.</p></div>
        <div class="arch-sub"><h5>Distance check module</h5><p>Applies to weekend trips only — major trips are unrestricted by radius.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="arch-layer">
      <span class="tag">Persistence layer</span><h3>Master travel database</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0;">28 destinations across India, each with coordinates, cost per day, duration range, and traveller-affinity tags — served from the API and browsable on the Explore page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="arch-layer">
      <span class="tag">Output layer</span><h3>Itinerary generation &amp; scheduling</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0;">A finalized major-trip day-by-day plan, and a curated 12-slot yearly weekend calendar — both on your My Trips dashboard, saved to your account.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">
  <section>
    <div class="section-head"><div class="section-tag">Rules reference</div><h2>What the engine checks</h2></div>
    <ul class="rule-list">
      <li><b>Duration</b> Weekend trips run 2–3 days (short-stay spots like Matheran are priced for their actual stay). Major trips run 7–10 days — only destinations that can fill your chosen window on the slider match.</li>
      <li><b>Radius</b> Weekend candidates must fall within your local radius (50–600 km, default 300 km) of your home city.</li>
      <li><b>Budget</b> Cost = cost-per-day × travellers × duration, checked against your weekend or major-trip budget in ₹.</li>
      <li><b>Affinity</b> Every destination is tagged solo, family with kids, and/or parents &amp; elders — only matching tags pass.</li>
      <li><b>Yearly cap</b> Weekend spend plus major-trip spend is tracked against your total yearly budget, and a destination can only be booked once per year.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div></div>

<div class="wrap"><footer>
  <div class="legend-row">
    <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--saffron);"></span>Input / control</span>
    <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--teal);"></span>Match / pass</span>
    <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--rose);"></span>Over budget</span>
    <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--muted);"></span>No match</span>
  </div>
  <div>Trip Control · all prices in ₹ · plan saved to your account</div>
</footer></div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="modalOverlay"><div class="modal-box" id="modalBox"></div></div>
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="/js/trip.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/ai.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>